# Claude ml-research archive

> A Claude conversation archive on the machine-learning research thread.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as a saved conversation shelf, not as a trained model. Source: fitzyracing1/claude-ml-research.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the chat history in this repo.
2. Use it to recall ML research talk.
3. Do not treat the archive as weights or a paper submission.

## Key ideas
- Conversation archive
- ML research thread
- Family of claude-* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-ml-research
archive = conversation_shelf("ml-research")
read(archive)
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. conversation_shelf("ml-research") → “this folder holds that thread”
2. read(archive) → “open the saved talk”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants runnable models → send them to an Everything-AI or sandbox repo
- If a reader wants the chat → stay here

## What a person would notice
A boxed conversation about research, not a checkpoint file.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the archive.
